# Intergrax — Iteration Instruction (Harness AI)

Implement the **Intergrax Harness AI / Agent Operating System**.

**Rules source:** this file only (always-on). **`AGENTS.md` is NOT auto-loaded** — use `@AGENTS.md` on demand (see `docs/guides/CURSOR_TOKEN_SETUP.md` F2).

## Session protocol (F3 — mandatory)

```text
ONE DOMAIN = ONE NEW CHAT
```

- **Audit / implement / closeout:** one domain pair per Cursor chat unless the operator explicitly batches.
- **Next domain:** open a **new chat** — do not continue prior domain's history in the same thread.
- **Resume:** new chat + bootstrap + `RESUME: docs/audit_results/YYYY-MM-DD/progress.json` only.
- Multi-domain threads cause linear history bloat (1M+ tokens) — forbidden unless operator opts in.

## Strategic frame

- **Harness is the product** — agents are replaceable; runtime is permanent.
- Default scope: **gate maintenance** in `docs/plan/PLATFORM_FOUNDATION.md` §6.1 (hub only; satellites under `docs/plan/plan/`).
- **Phase K** and **§6.3** require explicit operator reprioritization — never start silently.

## Context budget (mandatory — every session)

**Quality = targeted evidence, not bulk loading.**

- Read **only** the selected `docs/architecture/<DOMAIN>.md` (read-scope block) + plan **hub** + optional **one** satellite.
- **Never** load full multi-thousand-line plans — hub + [`docs/plan/plan/`](docs/plan/plan/); audits: [`docs/guides/audit_slices/<DOMAIN>.md`](docs/guides/audit_slices/).
- **Never** re-read the same file in one session unless it changed.
- Prefer **grep with path filters** over repo-wide semantic search.
- Verification commands: read `@AGENTS.md` §Verification only when running harness gates.
- Do **not** load `docs/audit_results/` unless RESUME says so.
- Respect **`.cursorignore`**.

## Documentation model

```text
docs/intergrax_runtime_architecture.md  ← hub
docs/architecture/<DOMAIN>.md             ← canon (scoped §)
docs/plan/<DOMAIN>.md                   ← plan hub
docs/guides/audit_slices/<DOMAIN>.md  ← audit compact slice
```

22 paired domains — routing table in **`AGENTS.md`** (on demand). Do **not** load unrelated pairs.

## Architecture (never violate)

```text
Tier-0 intergrax/  ·  Tier-1 intergrax/runtime/  ·  Tier-2 agents/  ·  Tier-3 applications/
intergrax/ ↛ agents/|applications/   agents/ ↛ applications/
```

**Always:** smallest coherent diff; reuse Tier-0. **Never:** Tier-0 duplication; business logic in Nexus; agent-specific Nexus branches; vendor SDK in Tier-2; whole-platform-complete claims.

**Mode I:** `audyt pomysłu` / `idea audit` → `.cursor/rules/intergrax-idea-audit.mdc` (no code until approved).

**New component gate:** insufficient mechanisms → STOP, explain, wait for operator.

## Language

Repository artifacts: English. Operator chat: primary language of the session.

